<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>LINE 태국 스티커 인기 순위 갤러리</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:"Segoe UI","Malgun Gothic",Tahoma,sans-serif;background:#f3f4f6;color:#111}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 16px}
h1{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 4px}.note{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-bottom:8px}
.bar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}
input,select,button{font:inherit;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px;background:#fff}
button{cursor:pointer}button.on{background:#06c755;color:#fff;border-color:#06c755}
.pages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}.pages button{min-width:78px;font-size:12px;padding:4px 6px}
main{padding:14px 16px 40px}.count{font-size:13px;color:#555;margin:2px 0 10px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(172px,1fr));gap:10px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1);position:relative;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block}
.card .img{aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.card img{max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain}
.rk{position:absolute;top:6px;left:6px;background:#06c755;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px}
.rk.top{background:#e5484d}.card .tx{padding:8px 10px 10px}
.ti{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;height:34px;overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical}
.me{font-size:11.5px;color:#666;margin-top:4px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.tag{display:inline-block;font-size:10.5px;background:#eef;border-radius:4px;padding:0 5px;margin-left:4px;color:#335}
</style></head><body>
<header><h1>LINE 스토어 태국 크리에이터 스티커 인기 순위 (스토어 인기 목록 순서, 누적 판매 순위 아님)</h1>
<div class="note">수집: 2026-10-06 · 판매량·판매액은 비공개 · 카드를 누르면 LINE 스토어 상품 페이지가 열립니다</div>
<div class="bar"><button id="tA" class="on">크리에이터 1~1000위</button><button id="tB">공식 1~100위</button>
<input id="q" placeholder="제목·스튜디오 검색" size="22"><select id="ty"><option value="">유형 전체</option><option value="static">정지</option><option value="animation">움직이는</option><option value="popup">팝업/효과</option><option value="animation_sound">움직임+소리</option></select>
<input id="go" type="number" min="1" placeholder="순위로 이동" style="width:110px"></div><div class="pages" id="pg"></div></header>
<main><div class="count" id="ct"></div><div class="grid" id="gr"></div></main>
